<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cartify - Belanja Mudah, Cepat, dan Terpercaya</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7fb;
      color: #1c1e21;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* NAVBAR */
    nav {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 18px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.8em;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1877f2;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .nav-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid #1877f2;
      color: #1877f2;
      background-color: transparent;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background-color: #e7f3ff;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #1877f2;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #1877f2;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #1565c0;
      border-color: #1565c0;
    }

    .btn-success {
      background-color: #42b72a;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #42b72a;
    }

    .btn-success:hover {
      background-color: #36a420;
      border-color: #36a420;
    }

    /* HERO SECTION */
    .hero {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      padding: 40px 8%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 50px;
      min-height: 75vh;
    }

    .hero-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #e7f3ff;
      color: #1877f2;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #1c1e21;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero-content h1 span {
      color: #1877f2;
    }

    .slogan {
      font-size: 1.2em;
      color: #55595c;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .hero-cta .btn {
      padding: 14px 30px;
      font-size: 1.05em;
    }

    /* ILLUSTRATION CARD */
    .hero-image {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .illustration-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1877f2 0%, #42a5f5 100%);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(24, 119, 242, 0.2);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
    }

    /* FEATURES SECTION */
    .features {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 60px 8%;
      border-top: 1px solid #e4e6eb;
    }

    .features-grid {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      border: 1px solid #ebedf0;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 2em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #1c1e21;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 0.92em;
      color: #606770;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #65676b;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px auto;
      }
      .slogan {
        margin: 0 auto 30px;
      }
      .hero-cta {
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .hero-content h1 {
        font-size: 2.3em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAVBAR -->
  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="brand">🛒 Cartify</a>
    <div class="nav-buttons">
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">Login</a>
      <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Register</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="badge">#1 Platform Belanja Pilihanmu</span>
      <h1>Penuhi Semua Kebutuhanmu di <span>Cartify</span></h1>
      <p class="slogan">
        "Klik, Masuk Keranjang, Langsung Checkout — Solusi belanja online praktis dengan harga terbaik dan invoice otomatis."
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-success">Mulai Belanja (Daftar)</a>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Masuk ke Akun</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-image">
      <div class="illustration-box">
        <svg width="180" height="180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
          <circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle>
          <path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 1.4em;">Belanja Tanpa Ribet</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9em; opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 6px;">
          Ribuan produk pilihan siap dikirim langsung ke pintu rumahmu.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Checkout Cepat</h3>
        <p>Kelola keranjang belanjaanmu dalam satu klik dan selesaikan transaksi tanpa antre.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
        <h3>Invoice PDF Otomatis</h3>
        <p>Bukti pembayaran dan rincian pesanan langsung tersedia dalam format PDF siap unduh.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
        <h3>Aman & Terkelola</h3>
        <p>Sistem akun terpisah antara Admin dan Customer untuk keamanan data serta stok produk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Cartify E-Commerce. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>